            "review_title": "Review at Rak Rock Lobster",
            "review_text": "GoPlaces59805999235\n6 contributions\n0\nDelicious Lobster at a reasonable price\nAug 2025 • Family\nThe food here is absolutely delicious and comes at a very reasonable price. The staff are friendly, attentive, and always ready to help, making the dining experience even more enjoyable. The atmosphere is wonderful - cozy yet vibrant and the restaurant is comfortably cool thanks to efficient air conditioning. Everything is kept spotlessly clean. A perfect place to enjoy fresh lobster and more!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 9, 2025",
